        "edit": "Widen the output port declaration from 1-bit 'output reg out' to 4-bit 'output reg [3:0] out' so the full 4-bit selected input is driven onto out, matching the 4-bit a/b/c/d inputs and the expected out[1] value at cycle 10.",
